Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:53:44 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560] | Words: 12 | Text: 为什么总有人非要逼走那个最爱自己的人
Segment #2   [00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,060] | Words: 6  | Text: 他们究竟在土什么
Segment #3   [00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,600] | Words: 7  | Text: 是在等一个更优秀
Segment #4   [00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,680] | Words: 5  | Text: 更好看的人吗
Segment #5   [00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,720] | Words: 9  | Text: 还是觉得下一个永远会更好
Segment #6   [00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,360] | Words: 7  | Text: 今天咱们不谈虚的
Segment #7   [00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 就撕开内层
Segment #8   [00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,600] | Words: 7  | Text: 我值得更好的绿静
Segment #9   [00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,940] | Words: 13 | Text: 聊聊那些被偏爱却有事无孔的人
Segment #10  [00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:15,980] | Words: 4  | Text: 到底在想什么
Segment #11  [00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,160] | Words: 10 | Text: 曾几何时爱一个人是珍惜
Segment #12  [00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,060] | Words: 9  | Text: 遇见一个真心对自己好的人
Segment #13  [00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,060] | Words: 7  | Text: 恨不得拿命去护
Segment #14  [00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,120] | Words: 8  | Text: 可现在社交软件一滑
Segment #15  [00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,440] | Words: 6  | Text: 好像谁都能说喜欢
Segment #16  [00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 爱没一抓
Segment #17  [00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,980] | Words: 7  | Text: 好像下一个永远更好
Segment #18  [00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,480] | Words: 8  | Text: 于是很多人产生错觉
Segment #19  [00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,500] | Words: 7  | Text: 这个走了下一个会更乖
Segment #20  [00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,620] | Words: 4  | Text: 可真相是
Segment #21  [00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,460] | Words: 9  | Text: 真心从来不是打折上皮
Segment #22  [00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 他是限量款
Segment #23  [00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,940] | Words: 7  | Text: 弄丢了就补不到货
Segment #24  [00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:37,140] | Words: 5  | Text: 我是面有个朋友
Segment #25  [00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,420] | Words: 8  | Text: 对方把他捧在手心
Segment #26  [00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,700] | Words: 6  | Text: 记得他所有记口
Segment #27  [00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,100] | Words: 7  | Text: 吵架永远先低头
Segment #28  [00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,340] | Words: 7  | Text: 半夜一句不舒服
Segment #29  [00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,700] | Words: 8  | Text: 他能跑半个成买药
Segment #30  [00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,040] | Words: 6  | Text: 可他先他无趣
Segment #31  [00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,000] | Words: 5  | Text: 先他管得多
Segment #32  [00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,280] | Words: 6  | Text: 后来他提分手
Segment #33  [00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,200] | Words: 6  | Text: 对方没吵没闹
Segment #34  [00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:48,900] | Words: 3  | Text: 只说好
Segment #35  [00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,300] | Words: 7  | Text: 他以为他会回头
Segment #36  [00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,000] | Words: 3  | Text: 结果没有
Segment #37  [00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,120] | Words: 5  | Text: 再后来他说
Segment #38  [00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,420] | Words: 7  | Text: 原来他不是没脾气
Segment #39  [00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,980] | Words: 8  | Text: 只是把脾气都淹下去了
Segment #40  [00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 很多人到底土什么
Segment #41  [00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,160] | Words: 3  | Text: 土新鲜
Segment #42  [00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,020] | Words: 4  | Text: 土被追捧
Segment #43  [00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 土用一个人的爱
Segment #44  [00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:00,480] | Words: 6  | Text: 证明自己有魅力
Segment #45  [00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:02,220] | Words: 9  | Text: 还是土那种我随时能走
Segment #46  [00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,900] | Words: 10 | Text: 他却永远在等的优越感
Segment #47  [00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,240] | Words: 6  | Text: 人性有时候就是这样
Segment #48  [00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,880] | Words: 10 | Text: 仗着对方的爱建立自信
Segment #49  [00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:09,000] | Words: 13 | Text: 就以为将来能吸引更多更好的人
Segment #50  [00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,700] | Words: 9  | Text: 可等到一定年纪回头看
Segment #51  [00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:13,080] | Words: 13 | Text: 你会发现真正爱你的人少之有少
Segment #52  [00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,040] | Words: 11 | Text: 连父母都不一定无条件爱你
Segment #53  [00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,580] | Words: 10 | Text: 更别说半路相遇的半路
Segment #54  [00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,420] | Words: 9  | Text: 有一个真心实意爱你的人
Segment #55  [00:01:18,420 --> 00:01:19,480] | Words: 6  | Text: 是非常喊见的事
Segment #56  [00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,420] | Words: 3  | Text: 真相是
Segment #57  [00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:22,180] | Words: 10 | Text: 绝大多数人都不是来爱你的
Segment #58  [00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 而是来消耗你的
Segment #59  [00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,320] | Words: 5  | Text: 你能伤害的
Segment #60  [00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,000] | Words: 3  | Text: 能遭他的
Segment #61  [00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,860] | Words: 8  | Text: 永远都是那些真的很爱
Segment #62  [00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:27,560] | Words: 4  | Text: 很爱你的人
Segment #63  [00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,700] | Words: 5  | Text: 他怕你生气
Segment #64  [00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:29,440] | Words: 4  | Text: 怕你失望
Segment #65  [00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:30,380] | Words: 3  | Text: 不是怕你
Segment #66  [00:01:30,380 --> 00:01:31,220] | Words: 4  | Text: 而是爱你
Segment #67  [00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:33,040] | Words: 9  | Text: 他也是别人眼中骄傲的人
Segment #68  [00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:33,800] | Words: 4  | Text: 也有脾气
Segment #69  [00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,440] | Words: 2  | Text: 底线
Segment #70  [00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,000] | Words: 2  | Text: 委屈
Segment #71  [00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,260] | Words: 10 | Text: 只是因为他爱你才敢远低头
Segment #72  [00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,960] | Words: 8  | Text: 脱邪为你包容不看
Segment #73  [00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,060] | Words: 5  | Text: 他收起冷脚
Segment #74  [00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:40,820] | Words: 4  | Text: 放下骄傲
Segment #75  [00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:41,700] | Words: 3  | Text: 小心翼翼
Segment #76  [00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,760] | Words: 6  | Text: 碰着对你的爱意
Segment #77  [00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,020] | Words: 7  | Text: 可你却是而不见
Segment #78  [00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:44,840] | Words: 4  | Text: 私意消耗
Segment #79  [00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,420] | Words: 7  | Text: 等他耗尽所有期待
Segment #80  [00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,600] | Words: 5  | Text: 退去所有职念
Segment #81  [00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,780] | Words: 6  | Text: 安静转身离开
Segment #82  [00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:49,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 不吵不闹
Segment #83  [00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:50,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 不再纠缠
Segment #84  [00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:51,440] | Words: 6  | Text: 你才会彻底明白
Segment #85  [00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,920] | Words: 6  | Text: 原来弄丢了他
Segment #86  [00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,620] | Words: 11 | Text: 就是弄丢了这辈子最好的偏爱
Segment #87  [00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:55,660] | Words: 5  | Text: 往后日子里
Segment #88  [00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:57,300] | Words: 10 | Text: 再没人实施前九年的任性
Segment #89  [00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,660] | Words: 7  | Text: 次次包容你的缺点
Segment #90  [00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:00,280] | Words: 10 | Text: 把你放在心间上偏爱你
Segment #91  [00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,960] | Words: 8  | Text: 成年人的世界没有重来
Segment #92  [00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,480] | Words: 9  | Text: 被你亲手推开的真心
Segment #93  [00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,100] | Words: 8  | Text: 此生再也遇不到第二次
Segment #94  [00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:07,680] | Words: 9  | Text: 所以别等失去才懂真心
Segment #95  [00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,960] | Words: 5  | Text: 被爱是运气
Segment #96  [00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,500] | Words: 7  | Text: 持续被爱是能力
Segment #97  [00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:11,580] | Words: 3  | Text: 你可以不爱
Segment #98  [00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:12,440] | Words: 4  | Text: 但别伤害
Segment #99  [00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,360] | Words: 3  | Text: 你可以不选
Segment #100 [00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 但别遭疼
Segment #101 [00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,940] | Words: 9  | Text: 那个还愿意为你低头的人
Segment #102 [00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:16,800] | Words: 3  | Text: 不是欠你
Segment #103 [00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:17,560] | Words: 3  | Text: 是爱你
Segment #104 [00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,280] | Words: 4  | Text: 一旦弄丢
Segment #105 [00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,220] | Words: 4  | Text: 就是一辈子
